A||N||10||Jay||I am now officially Fieroless||||1||
Z||000000||Jay||12-29-2001||12:03 AM||||Well, I delivered the N* this morning to Windsor Ontario (Across from Detroit) to the new owner. After owning 3 Fiero's I am now Fieroless. The new owner seems to be a Fiero nut like us.  In fact he already has a Fiero back home.  He's gonna drive the car back to Los Angeles and I've told him about this wonderful place.  I hope he will join and be a part of it.  I wanted to thank everyone who has helped me out along the way...Will, Artherd, Northstar87 and all the rest.  This has been a unique place over the past few years.  I'm not leaving entirely, just making myself more scarce.  BTW where is the video of my car at the drag strip (Grinthock)? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I'd like to see it sometime before the next millenium! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Take care everyone and keep the car alive!  It has been a priviledge to be a part of this community! <P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||72vinman||12-29-2001||12:28 AM||||Jay, The pleasure has been all ours. Pictures of your N* were one of the main reasons I decided to buy my GT and join the GTA club. It was even better looking in person. That car will be missed, but so will you if stop coming around here. I hope this does not mean your leaving the GTA club. It wouldn't be the same without you. Take care and have fun with your Ferrari. See you around<BR>Vince<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin2_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jay||12-29-2001||03:37 AM||||Thanks for  the kind words Vince.  I'll still send you stupid emails <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  Yeah, I rolled down the window to hear the rumble for the last time as he drove across the bridge to  the US.  Miss it already.||||reg||1
